      "notes": "KP government women-only Pink Bus (not a private service); suspended in 2019. Government women-only Pink Bus using buses donated by Japan, launched 2019-04-04, not a private route. Stop order merges two sources that agree on the core sequence. PakWheels (2019) adds 'Girls Primary School' after Baghdada Chowk. Dawn (2018, pre-launch plan) adds 'Mardan Bus Stop' and 'Toru CNG Bus Stop' before the Garden Campus terminus, and PakWheels omits them. Sources name 15-16 bus stops. PakWheels gives 3 buses at launch plus 4 from 2019-04-08 and a Rs20 fare. Geo says 10 buses, which conflicts. Suspended a few months after launch, and the 2021 report says KP shut it for lack of an operator. Treat as defunct or historical."
